WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.344
Cubosomes contain structured internal lipid domains. Their morphology is

00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:10.138
intriguing, but drug delivery is not secured by geometry alone.

00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:20.403
Theranostics links therapeutic and diagnostic ambitions. These

00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:24.589
are distinct performance claims with different measurement needs.

00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:33.979
Lipid composition, loading and surrounding biological fluids

00:00:33.979 --> 00:00:37.992
affect the practical behaviour of a nanoscale carrier.

00:00:43.217 --> 00:00:46.769
A ligand or proposed uptake mechanism does

00:00:46.769 --> 00:00:50.322
not alone demonstrate selective tumour delivery in vivo.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:59.680
Stability, biodistribution, safety and reproducibility determine whether

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:04.310
a promising system can move toward clinical evaluation.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:14.536
The forthcoming accepted chapter critically discusses cancer-targeted cubosome

00:01:14.536 --> 00:01:18.938
design and the difficult path to clinical translation.
